Date: Fri, 22 Dec 2023 14:34:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 846/954] refactor(tc): update platform tests

Update the TC's platform test Makefile and related common definitions
to correspond to newer TF-M code (commit hash: 4ab7a20).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 159cc198b92e47edc61d50f59f8f3e05c4d66f3e refactor(tc): update platform tests]
