Signed-off-by: David Vincze <david.vincze@arm.com>
(cherry picked from commit a93bf0aacaf696baaa0d93e9d945f4045c9ae125)
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/443838
